Description: avcodec/vvc: preserve the base picture of multilayer access units
 Returning AVERROR_PATCHWELCOME for an unsupported layer aborts the
 whole access unit, including a layer-0 picture already being decoded.
 This contradicts the intent of bb9e4ff355 to skip enhancement NALs.
 .
 Keep the existing layer-0 restriction, skip unsupported NAL units and
 warn once. Read only layer-0 prefix SEI in the separate prefix scan so
 another layer's metadata cannot reach the decoded picture (H.266
 D.2.2). Returning success for skipped NALs also keeps enhancement suffix
 SEI from overwriting the base picture's decoded-picture hash.
 .
 With complete access units from the parser fix, VPS_A_3 and OPI_B_3
 decode all nine and seventeen base pictures, matching independent
 layer-0 extractions and their decoded-picture hashes.
 .
